    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "线性微分方程的可变换充分条件",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "The Laplace transform exists for linear differential equations for which the transformation integral converges. Therefore, for $f(t)$ to be transformable, it is sufficient that\n\n$$\n\\int_{0^{-}}^{\\infty}|f(t)| e^{-\\sigma_{1} t} d t<\\infty\n$$\n\nwith sigma_1 real and positive.",
